<title>UK: Nova Scotia sets C$250 million Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Nova Scotia sets C$250 million Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PROVINCE OF NOVA SCOTIA</p>
<p> AMT    C$250 MLN     COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.145   PAY DATE  S 18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.57     SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N S/CAN   HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.3	 SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 8.5 PCT APR 2002 AND 7.25</p>
<p>			    JUNE 2003 CANADAS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
